Baume Moisture Kick : on a teste le soin sans rincage a l'acide hyaluronique\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Notre avis sur le Spray-Baume Moisture Kick de Schwarzkopf. Acide hyaluronique, hydratation profonde, anti-casse : on te dit tout sur ce soin capillaire sans rincage.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-03-29\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-03-29\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/schwarzkopf-spray-baume-moisture-kick-hydratation-avis-2026.svg\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/schwarzkopf-spray-baume-moisture-kick-hydratation-avis-2026\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/icon.svg\\\"}}}\"}}],null,[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Accueil\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Beauté\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/categorie/beaute\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Schwarzkopf Spray-Baume Moisture Kick : on a teste le soin sans rincage a l'acide hyaluronique\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"activePage\":\"/blog\"}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"article-page\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"breadcrumbs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"children\":\"Accueil\"}